    "title": "The Starting 22: Best players from Week 1 of the 2026 NC high school football season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joel Bryant ,\n7 hours ago For each week of the 2026 high school football season, HighSchoolOT will release the Starting 22. It lists the best performances from every position across North Carolina. Coaches should send in performance nominations to HighSchoolOT@wral.com for consideration each week. Players cannot be selected again later in the year, as the goal is to shine a light on as many players as possible. Read full article",
